{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y在S02把“差点藏不住又收住”放到“先舍不得会结束”之后，局部情绪推进不如X原来的顺序自然。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y的放大关键词让我扫一眼就能抓住每句话的转折，而感受紧跟对应的话、部分又到时才出现，不容易像X那样在左右两堆文字之间来回配对。它也更清楚地保留了“靠近—怕暴露—确认没被推开—敢期待—又怕失去—最后不再往回藏”的因果线；感受多是具体的身体、声音和空间变化，比X大量并列短词更容易在听音乐时形成细腻而连续的体验。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c6a0a416-e8bd-4e57-931c-0f07c5128834", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T030933770121Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.968, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:09:41.747530+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2673c02eb21b87be4e545addd79aee2c00c6ae676ded0ea3574fa3e96c3a97c5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evid